{"id":"wb-1-52","name":"平阳府君阙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"平阳府君阙","text":"平阳府君阙是位于四川省绵阳市游仙区芙蓉溪畔仙人桥旁，绵阳博物馆新馆前，是一处建于东汉末期的汉阙，双阙俱存。平阳府君阙由南北二阙组成，两阙相距约27米。南北二阙又分别由主阙与副阙构成，为仿木质结构建筑。\n1956年8月16日公布为四川省第一批历史及革命文物保护单位。1961年3月4日列为第一批全国重点文物保护单位。1980年7月7日重新公布为四川省第一批文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B9%B3%E9%98%B3%E5%BA%9C%E5%90%9B%E9%98%99","revisionId":76530049,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=76530049","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/244327165e0bd8f721660418.jpg","title":"Youxian,_Mianyang,_Sichuan,_China_-_panoramio_(12).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Youxian,_Mianyang,_Sichuan,_China_-_panoramio_(12).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b4/Youxian%2C_Mianyang%2C_Sichuan%2C_China_-_panoramio_%2812%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"ping lin","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"Youxian, Mianyang, Sichuan, China","width":320,"height":240}}